    "slug": "journee-de-lexcellence-de-la-formation-professionnelle-et-technique-2",
    "link": "https:\/\/formation.gouv.sn\/?p=10397",
    "title": {
      "rendered": "Journ\u00e9e de l\u2019Excellence de la Formation professionnelle et technique"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/formation.gouv.sn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/10-DEC-3-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10398\" srcset=\"https:\/\/formation.gouv.sn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/10-DEC-3-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/formation.gouv.sn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/10-DEC-3-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/formation.gouv.sn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/10-DEC-3-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/formation.gouv.sn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/10-DEC-3-768x768.jpg 768w, https:\/\/formation.gouv.sn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/10-DEC-3-540x540.jpg 540w, https:\/\/formation.gouv.sn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/10-DEC-3.jpg 1440w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/tc\/1\/16\/1f345.png\" alt=\"\ud83c\udf45\"> Innover pour nourrir durablement !<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Le groupe d\u2019apprenants du Lyc\u00e9e Technique Industriel Maurice Delafosse, compos\u00e9 de 4 jeunes visionnaires, s\u2019est distingu\u00e9 lors de la Journ\u00e9e de l\u2019Excellence de la Formation professionnelle et technique (FPT) dans la r\u00e9gion de Dakar gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un projet ambitieux : la production et la transformation de la tomate et du gombo <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" alt=\"\ud83c\udf3e\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t9d\/1\/16\/1f33e.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" alt=\"\ud83c\udf45\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/tc\/1\/16\/1f345.png\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Leur initiative consiste \u00e0 cultiver ces produits sur leur propre champ puis \u00e0 les transformer localement pour r\u00e9duire les pertes post-r\u00e9colte et renforcer l\u2019autonomie alimentaire.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Ils pr\u00e9voient de produire de la tomate concentr\u00e9e 100 % naturelle, sans additif, ainsi que du gombo transform\u00e9 et conditionn\u00e9 dans des sachets de conservation, permettant son utilisation tout au long de l\u2019ann\u00e9e, m\u00eame pendant les p\u00e9riodes de raret\u00e9 sur le march\u00e9 <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" alt=\"\ud83c\udf31\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t69\/1\/16\/1f331.png\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Ce projet allie innovation, durabilit\u00e9 et engagement social, illustrant la volont\u00e9 de ces jeunes de valoriser les ressources locales et de promouvoir une alimentation saine et accessible au S\u00e9n\u00e9gal <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" alt=\"\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\uddf3\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t25\/1\/16\/1f1f8_1f1f3.png\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Mastercard FoundationYMCA SenegalEducation Development CenterCaritas S\u00e9n\u00e9galMinist\u00e8re de l\u2019Emploi et de la Formation professionnelleCaritas KoldaONG Jeunesse Et D\u00e9veloppement@Ecoles au S\u00e9n\u00e9gal.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/hashtag\/pfpi?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDU6FjzGGGcbmlQG9GXYMeWOGP_vh3sL7L58DZUiufHuxcuLMeXe7cd9LpP6GnPOsgkigrMkltDNVPEf6J3AWY_QK7X971v-uBg9eNBbNnpXn5JCXWRIsVEvj3TpXg_cl_RtNhn2z5zVgWwwnr3LX1&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\">#Pfpi<\/a>#Journ\u00e9eDeLExcellencee <a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/hashtag\/fpt?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDU6FjzGGGcbmlQG9GXYMeWOGP_vh3sL7L58DZUiufHuxcuLMeXe7cd9LpP6GnPOsgkigrMkltDNVPEf6J3AWY_QK7X971v-uBg9eNBbNnpXn5JCXWRIsVEvj3TpXg_cl_RtNhn2z5zVgWwwnr3LX1&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\">#FPT<\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/hashtag\/dakar?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDU6FjzGGGcbmlQG9GXYMeWOGP_vh3sL7L58DZUiufHuxcuLMeXe7cd9LpP6GnPOsgkigrMkltDNVPEf6J3AWY_QK7X971v-uBg9eNBbNnpXn5JCXWRIsVEvj3TpXg_cl_RtNhn2z5zVgWwwnr3LX1&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\">#dakar<\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/hashtag\/transformationagroalimentaire?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDU6FjzGGGcbmlQG9GXYMeWOGP_vh3sL7L58DZUiufHuxcuLMeXe7cd9LpP6GnPOsgkigrMkltDNVPEf6J3AWY_QK7X971v-uBg9eNBbNnpXn5JCXWRIsVEvj3TpXg_cl_RtNhn2z5zVgWwwnr3LX1&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\">#TransformationAgroalimentaire<\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/hashtag\/entrepreneuriatjeune?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDU6FjzGGGcbmlQG9GXYMeWOGP_vh3sL7L58DZUiufHuxcuLMeXe7cd9LpP6GnPOsgkigrMkltDNVPEf6J3AWY_QK7X971v-uBg9eNBbNnpXn5JCXWRIsVEvj3TpXg_cl_RtNhn2z5zVgWwwnr3LX1&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\">#EntrepreneuriatJeune<\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/hashtag\/innovationdurable?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDU6FjzGGGcbmlQG9GXYMeWOGP_vh3sL7L58DZUiufHuxcuLMeXe7cd9LpP6GnPOsgkigrMkltDNVPEf6J3AWY_QK7X971v-uBg9eNBbNnpXn5JCXWRIsVEvj3TpXg_cl_RtNhn2z5zVgWwwnr3LX1&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\">#InnovationDurable<\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/hashtag\/autonomiealimentaire?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDU6FjzGGGcbmlQG9GXYMeWOGP_vh3sL7L58DZUiufHuxcuLMeXe7cd9LpP6GnPOsgkigrMkltDNVPEf6J3AWY_QK7X971v-uBg9eNBbNnpXn5JCXWRIsVEvj3TpXg_cl_RtNhn2z5zVgWwwnr3LX1&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\">#autonomiealimentaire<\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/hashtag\/se%CC%81ne%CC%81gal?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDU6FjzGGGcbmlQG9GXYMeWOGP_vh3sL7L58DZUiufHuxcuLMeXe7cd9LpP6GnPOsgkigrMkltDNVPEf6J3AWY_QK7X971v-uBg9eNBbNnpXn5JCXWRIsVEvj3TpXg_cl_RtNhn2z5zVgWwwnr3LX1&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\">#s\u00e9n\u00e9gal<\/a><\/p>\n",
